 "reading": "Sun and planets differ by at most 0.09 arcsec; the Moon by up to 0.64 arcsec before 1972 and 0.39 arcsec after, which corresponds to roughly 1.2 s and 0.7 s of time. After 1972 that is the unmodeled UT1-UTC (|UT1-UTC| < 0.9 s); before 1972 it is the difference between the smoothed polynomial fits and the reference table. Closing it needs measured UT1-UTC/Delta T data, which this package does not bundle.",
